{"id":"c1c52f8c4625c61730d5ae82b3cfa801db7d93fe","url":"https://fellowgeek.github.io/mcp-speak","title":"MCP // SPEAK — Neural Audio Synthesizer Interface for AI Agents","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"fellowgeek.github.io","byline":null,"excerpt":"SIGNAL ACQUIRED // BUFFER COPIED","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n\n<!--\nTHESIS: MCP Speak is not another SaaS audio player; it is an industrial neural synthesizer rack that gives cold, intelligent command voices to AI agents on macOS.\nOWN-WORLD: Dark matte chassis (#10121a), amber phosphor CRT glow (#ffb000), tactile hardware switches, real-time oscilloscope canvas, and modular cartridge racks.\nSTORY: Developers discover real-time voice design for agents, test responsive neural personas via live synthesis, and generate tailored IDE instruction files in seconds.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: High-contrast telemetry header, dual-mode mechanical command console, live interactive phosphor oscilloscope visualizer, and instant installation triggers.\nFORM: Cassette-futurism synthesizer mainframe (candidate 4, signals-instruments-phosphor-terminal-midnight, seed e77e4718).\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md\n-->\n\n    <!-- Telemetry Notification HUD -->\n    <div id=\"toast\">\n        \n        <p><span id=\"toast-message\">SIGNAL ACQUIRED // BUFFER COPIED</span>\n    </p></div>\n\n    <!-- Telemetry Navigation Header -->\n    <header>\n        \n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Stream -->\n    <main>\n\n        <!-- HERO SECTION: The Master Audio Telemetry Console -->\n        <div id=\"console\">\n                \n                <!-- Left Column: Mission Directives & Hook -->\n                <div>\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>SYSTEM: ONLINE</span>\n                        <span>|</span>\n                        <span>APPLE SILICON MPS LOADED</span>\n                    </p>\n\n                    <h2>\n                        We gave the agents a voice. <br>\n                        <span>Sorry in advance.</span>\n                    </h2>\n\n                    <p>\n                        A specialized Model Context Protocol server for macOS that synthesizes real-time speech via OmniVoice and native macOS say. AI agents proactively announce status updates, ask clarifying questions, and deliver vocal feedback during pairing sessions.\n                    </p>\n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Hardware Spec Strip -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Synthesis Engine</p>\n                            <p><span></span>\n                                OmniVoice + Say\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Audio Queue</p>\n                            <p><span></span>\n                                Non-Overlapping FIFO\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Latency Profile</p>\n                            <p><span></span>\n                                Sub-Second MPS\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Column: Interactive Oscilloscope CRT Monitor -->\n                <div>\n                        \n                        <!-- CRT Header Bar -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p><i></i>\n                                <span>OSCILLOSCOPE // TRACE CH-1</span>\n                            </p>\n                            <p><span id=\"sample-rate-readout\">48.0 kHz</span>\n                                <span></span>\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Canvas Waveform Area -->\n                        \n\n                        <!-- VU Meter & Synthesis Controls -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p><span>SIGNAL LEVEL (L/R)</span>\n                                <span id=\"decibel-readout\">-12.4 dB</span>\n                            </p>\n                            \n\n                            <div>\n                                <p>MODE: CONTINUOUS SYNTHESIS</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 02: Modular Installation Bay -->\n        <section id=\"install\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        BAY 01 // DEPLOYMENT PROTOCOL\n                    </p>\n                    <h2>System Installation</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>AUTOMATED LOCAL PROVISIONING</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n                \n                <!-- Step 1 Card -->\n                <div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>\n                                01\n                            </p>\n                            </div>\n                        <h3>Clone Codebase</h3>\n                        <p>\n                            Retrieve the repository files to your local macOS filesystem and change into the root workspace.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p><code>git clone https://github.com/fellowgeek/mcp-speak.git &amp;&amp; cd mcp-speak</code>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Step 2 Card -->\n                <div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>\n                                02\n                            </p>\n                            </div>\n                        <h3>Execute Setup Wizard</h3>\n                        <p>\n                            Launches the interactive setup wizard to select your TTS engine, configure agent personas, set execution permissions, and create your Python virtual environment.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p><code>python3 setup.py</code>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 03: Client Integration Matrix -->\n        <section id=\"config\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        BAY 02 // MANUAL CONFIGURATION RACK\n                    </p>\n                    <h2>Client Integration</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>AUTOMATICALLY HANDLED BY SETUP.PY</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Client Selector Tabs -->\n            <div>\n                    <p><span id=\"config-path-label\">\n                            <i></i>\n                            <span>~/.gemini/antigravity/mcp_config.json</span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </p>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <pre id=\"config-code-block\">{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"voice\": {\n      \"command\": \"/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/run.sh\"\n    }\n  }\n}</pre>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 04: The Persona Matrix (Voice Cartridge Rack) -->\n        <section id=\"matrix\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        BAY 03 // MODULAR VOICE MATRIX\n                    </p>\n                    <h2>Personality Cartridges</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>CLICK CARTRIDGE TO PATCH &amp; AUDITION</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Cartridge Grid (10 Personas - Full Color Images) -->\n            <div>\n                \n                <!-- 1. Sarcastic Senior -->\n                <div id=\"cart-senior\" onclick=\"selectPersona('senior', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-01</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/sarcastic_senior.webp\" alt=\"Sarcastic Senior\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Sarcastic Senior</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 2. Eager Intern -->\n                <div id=\"cart-intern\" onclick=\"selectPersona('intern', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-02</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/over_eager_intern.webp\" alt=\"Eager Intern\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Eager Intern</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 3. Existential Emo -->\n                <div id=\"cart-emo\" onclick=\"selectPersona('emo', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-03</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/existential_emo.webp\" alt=\"Existential Emo\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Existential Emo</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 4. Pun Master -->\n                <div id=\"cart-pun\" onclick=\"selectPersona('pun', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-04</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/pun_master.webp\" alt=\"Pun Master\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Pun Master</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 5. Tech Priest -->\n                <div id=\"cart-priest\" onclick=\"selectPersona('priest', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-05</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/tech_priest.webp\" alt=\"Tech Priest\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Tech Priest</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 6. Agent Smith -->\n                <div id=\"cart-smith\" onclick=\"selectPersona('smith', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-06</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/agent_smith.webp\" alt=\"Agent Smith\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Agent Smith</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 7. Gothic Poet -->\n                <div id=\"cart-poet\" onclick=\"selectPersona('poet', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-07</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/poet.webp\" alt=\"Gothic Poet\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Gothic Poet</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 8. Nature Narrator -->\n                <div id=\"cart-narrator\" onclick=\"selectPersona('narrator', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-08</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/nature_narrator.webp\" alt=\"Nature Narrator\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Nature Narrator</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 9. Fiery Head Chef -->\n                <div id=\"cart-chef\" onclick=\"selectPersona('chef', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-09</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/head_chef.webp\" alt=\"Head Chef\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Head Chef</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 10. Neutral Mainframe -->\n                <div id=\"cart-mainframe\" onclick=\"selectPersona('mainframe', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-10</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/neutral_mainframe.webp\" alt=\"Neutral Mainframe\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Neutral Mainframe</p>\n                    </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 05: Mainframe Prompt Compiler & Teleprompter -->\n        <section id=\"generator\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        BAY 04 // AGENT INSTRUCTION GENERATOR\n                    </p>\n                    <h2>Prompt Compiler</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>PATCH &amp; COMPILE SYSTEM INSTRUCTIONS</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Left Column: Controls & Parameters -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>PATCHED MODULE</p>\n                            <h3 id=\"persona-title\">Sarcastic Senior</h3>\n                            <p id=\"persona-desc\">\n                                Intelligent, unimpressed, and slightly judgmental. This persona acts like a veteran developer tired of seeing mediocre code.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Parameter Registers -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p><label>\n                                    [REGISTER 01] User Identifier\n                                </label>\n                                \n                            </p>\n\n                            <div>\n                                <p><span>[REGISTER 02] Target AI Architecture</span>\n                                    <span>SELECT_PORT</span>\n                                </p>\n                                \n                            </div>\n\n                            <p>\n                                <label for=\"include-base\">\n                                    Include 