 judgmental.","zh":null},{"en":"This persona acts like a veteran developer tired of seeing mediocre code.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><label>\n                                    [REGISTER 01] User Identifier\n                                </label>\n                                \n                            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"[REGISTER 01] User Identifier","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>[REGISTER 02] Target AI Architecture</span>\n                                    <span>SELECT_PORT</span>\n                                </p>","sentences":[{"en":"[REGISTER 02] Target AI Architecture SELECT_PORT","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                                <label for=\"include-base\">\n                                    Include Core Voice Protocol Guidelines\n                                </label>\n                            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Include Core Voice Protocol Guidelines","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                                Real-time dynamic compilation on parameter change\n                            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Real-time dynamic compilation on parameter change","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span id=\"gen-label\">\n                                <i></i>\n                                <span>COMPILED AGENTS.MD</span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span id=\"save-hint\">\n                                SAVE IN: PROJECT ROOT OR ~/.codex/AGENTS.md\n                            </span>\n                        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"COMPILED AGENTS.MD SAVE IN: PROJECT ROOT OR ~/.codex/AGENTS.md","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n\n<!--\nTHESIS: MCP Speak is not another SaaS audio player; it is an industrial neural synthesizer rack that gives cold, intelligent command voices to AI agents on macOS.\nOWN-WORLD: Dark matte chassis (#10121a), amber phosphor CRT glow (#ffb000), tactile hardware switches, real-time oscilloscope canvas, and modular cartridge racks.\nSTORY: Developers discover real-time voice design for agents, test responsive neural personas via live synthesis, and generate tailored IDE instruction files in seconds.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: High-contrast telemetry header, dual-mode mechanical command console, live interactive phosphor oscilloscope visualizer, and instant installation triggers.\nFORM: Cassette-futurism synthesizer mainframe (candidate 4, signals-instruments-phosphor-terminal-midnight, seed e77e4718).\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md\n-->\n\n    <!-- Telemetry Notification HUD -->\n    <div id=\"toast\">\n        \n        <p>SIGNAL ACQUIRED // BUFFER COPIED</p></div>\n\n    <!-- Telemetry Navigation Header -->\n    <header>\n        \n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Stream -->\n    <main>\n\n        <!-- HERO SECTION: The Master Audio Telemetry Console -->\n        <div id=\"console\">\n                \n                <!-- Left Column: Mission Directives & Hook -->\n                <div>\n                    <p>SYSTEM: ONLINE | APPLE SILICON MPS LOADED</p>\n\n                    <h2>We gave the agents a voice. Sorry in advance.</h2>\n\n                    <p>A specialized Model Context Protocol server for macOS that synthesizes real-time speech via OmniVoice and native macOS say. AI agents proactively announce status updates, ask clarifying questions, and deliver vocal feedback during pairing sessions.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Hardware Spec Strip -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Synthesis Engine</p>\n                            <p>OmniVoice + Say</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Audio Queue</p>\n                            <p>Non-Overlapping FIFO</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Latency Profile</p>\n                            <p>Sub-Second MPS</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Column: Interactive Oscilloscope CRT Monitor -->\n                <div>\n                        \n                        <!-- CRT Header Bar -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p>OSCILLOSCOPE // TRACE CH-1</p>\n                            <p><span id=\"sample-rate-readout\">48.0 kHz</span>\n                                <span></span>\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Canvas Waveform Area -->\n                        \n\n                        <!-- VU Meter & Synthesis Controls -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p>SIGNAL LEVEL (L/R) -12.4 dB</p>\n                            \n\n                            <div>\n                                <p>MODE: CONTINUOUS SYNTHESIS</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 02: Modular Installation Bay -->\n        <section id=\"install\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p>BAY 01 // DEPLOYMENT PROTOCOL</p>\n                    <h2>System Installation</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>AUTOMATED LOCAL PROVISIONING</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n                \n                <!-- Step 1 Card -->\n                <div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>\n                                01\n                            </p>\n                            </div>\n                        <h3>Clone Codebase</h3>\n                        <p>Retrieve the repository files to your local macOS filesystem and change into the root workspace.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p>git 克隆 https://github.com/fellowgeek/mcp-speak.git &amp;&amp; cd mcp-speak</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Step 2 Card -->\n                <div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>\n                                02\n                            </p>\n                            </div>\n                        <h3>Execute Setup Wizard</h3>\n                        <p>Launches the interactive setup wizard to select your TTS engine, configure agent personas, set execution permissions, and create your Python virtual environment.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p>python3安装程序.py</p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 03: Client Integration Matrix -->\n        <section id=\"config\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p>BAY 02 // MANUAL CONFIGURATION RACK</p>\n                    <h2>Client Integration</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>AUTOMATICALLY HANDLED BY SETUP.PY</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Client Selector Tabs -->\n            <div>\n                    <p>~/.gemini/antigravity/mcp_config.json</p>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <pre id=\"config-code-block\">{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"voice\": {\n      \"command\": \"/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/run.sh\"\n    }\n  }\n}</pre>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 04: The Persona Matrix (Voice Cartridge Rack) -->\n        <section id=\"matrix\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p>BAY 03 // MODULAR VOICE MATRIX</p>\n                    <h2>Personality Cartridges</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>CLICK CARTRIDGE TO PATCH &amp; AUDITION</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Cartridge Grid (10 Personas - Full Color Images) -->\n            <div>\n                \n                <!-- 1. Sarcastic Senior -->\n                <div id=\"cart-senior\" onclick=\"selectPersona('senior', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-01</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/sarcastic_senior.webp\" alt=\"Sarcastic Senior\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>讽刺前辈</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 2. Eager Intern -->\n                <div id=\"cart-intern\" onclick=\"selectPersona('intern', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-02</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/over_eager_intern.webp\" alt=\"Eager Intern\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>热心实习生</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 3. Existential Emo -->\n                <div id=\"cart-emo\" onclick=\"selectPersona('emo', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-03</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/existential_emo.webp\" alt=\"Existential Emo\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>存在主义情绪</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 4. Pun Master -->\n                <div id=\"cart-pun\" onclick=\"selectPersona('pun', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-04</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/pun_master.webp\" alt=\"Pun Master\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>连大师</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 5. Tech Priest -->\n                <div id=\"cart-priest\" onclick=\"selectPersona('priest', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-05</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/tech_priest.webp\" alt=\"Tech Priest\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>科技牧师</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 6. Agent Smith -->\n                <div id=\"cart-smith\" onclick=\"selectPersona('smith', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-06</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/agent_smith.webp\" alt=\"Agent Smith\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>史密斯特工</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 7. Gothic Poet -->\n                <div id=\"cart-poet\" onclick=\"selectPersona('poet', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-07</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/poet.webp\" alt=\"Gothic Poet\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>哥特诗人</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 8. Nature Narrator -->\n                <div id=\"cart-narrator\" onclick=\"selectPersona('narrator', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-08</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/nature_narrator.webp\" alt=\"Nature Narrator\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Nature Narrator</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 9. Fiery Head Chef -->\n                <div id=\"cart-chef\" onclick=\"selectPersona('chef', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-09</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/head_chef.webp\" alt=\"Head Chef\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Head Chef</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                <!-- 10. Neutral Mainframe -->\n                <div id=\"cart-mainframe\" onclick=\"selectPersona('mainframe', this)\">\n                    <p><span></span>\n                        <span>MOD-10</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p><img src=\"images/neutral_mainframe.webp\" alt=\"Neutral Mainframe\">\n                    </p>\n                    <p>Neutral Mainframe</p>\n                    </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- SECTION 05: Mainframe Prompt Compiler & Teleprompter -->\n        <section id=\"generator\">\n            <div>\n                <div>\n                    <p>BAY 04 // AGENT INSTRUCTION GENERATOR</p>\n                    <h2>Prompt Compiler</h2>\n                </div>\n                <p>PATCH &amp; COMPILE SYSTEM INSTRUCTIONS</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Left Column: Controls & Parameters -->\n                    <div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p>PATCHED MODULE</p>\n                            <h3 id=\"persona-title\">讽刺前辈</h3>\n                            <p id=\"persona-desc\">Intelligent, unimpressed, and slightly judgmental. This persona acts like a veteran developer tired of seeing mediocre code.</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Parameter Registers -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p>[REGISTER 01] User Identifier</p>\n\n                            <div>\n                                <p>[REGISTER 02] Target AI Architecture SELECT_PORT</p>\n                                \n                            </div>\n\n                            <p>Include Core Voice Protocol Guidelines</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Compile Action Trigger -->\n                        <div>\n                            <p>Real-time dynamic compilation on parameter change</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column: CRT Teleprompter Output -->\n                    <div>\n                        <p>COMPILED AGENTS.MD SAVE IN: PROJECT ROOT OR ~/.codex/AGENTS.md</p>\n\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Technical Hardware Footer -->\n    \n\n    <!-- Interactive Telemetry Engine & Waveform Simulation Script -->\n    \n</div>"}